      "widgets_values": [
        "Add in the camera type here choosing it by model. and node plug in.\n\nhad to disable \"widget to string\" coz it errored not sure why. maybe the camera embed node is newupdated as it looks different to Art Officials version.\n\nnote: \"orbit\" node didnt orbit round the subject but looked around the room, so orbited on its own access 90 degrees.\n\narc right worked nicely and focused on the main subjects. but best done before VACE swapping the characters for better consistency. also translate up is a crane shot.\n\n---\n\nFor camera movement trajectories, we offer 10 basic camera trajectories as follows:\nIndex \tBasic Trajectory\n1 \tPan Right\n2 \tPan Left\n3 \tTilt Up\n4 \tTilt Down\n5 \tZoom In\n6 \tZoom Out\n7 \tTranslate Up (with rotation)\n8 \tTranslate Down (with rotation)\n9 \tArc Left (with rotation)\n10 \tArc Right (with rotation)"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
